* [[Red-billed Pigeon]] ''Columba flavirostris''
* [[Band-tailed Pigeon]] ''Columba fasciata''
* [[Hill Pigeon]], ''Columba rupestris''
* [[Snow Pigeon]], ''Columba leuconota''
