* {{imdb name|name=Stephen Fry|id=0000410}}
* [http://www.pgwodehousebooks.com/fry.htm Stephen Fry on PG Wodehouse]
* [http://www.musicomh.com/interviews/stephen-fry.htm Stephen Fry interview]


